Package: pithyx-kernel
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Pithyx <https://github.com/pithyx/pithyx>
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Depends: linux-image-@KVER@ (= @KERNEL_VERSION@), pithyx-zfs-modules-@KVER@ (= @ZFS_VERSION@), zfsutils-linux (= @ZFS_VERSION@)
Conflicts: zfs-dkms, linux-image-amd64, linux-headers-amd64
Replaces: zfs-dkms
Description: The kernel and ZFS module pair of a Pithyx release
 Pins the kernel and a ZFS module built for exactly that kernel, so they only change together through a Pithyx
 update and a kernel from Debian can never leave the box without its pools (D297, D338). No dkms on the box.
